<title>CANADA: Cogeco Cable to sell 4 mln shares, warrants.</title>
<headline>Cogeco Cable to sell 4 mln shares, warrants.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cogeco Cable Inc said on Wednesday a syndicate of underwriters have agreed to buy and sell to the public four million subordinate voting shares and special warrants for an aggregate amount of C$48.4 million.</p>
<p>It said each special warrant will be exercisable with no additional payment into one subordinate voting share of Cogeco Cable. Proceeds of the issue will be used to repay bank debt, it said.</p>
<p>Closing is expected by August 19.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
